 "not_a_claim": [
  "not an RTL measurement and not a simulation: this is the committed analytical roofline evaluated at a 826 mm2 area budget",
  "the ROM capacity density is graded 'derived' and the SRAM capacity density it is built beside is graded 'assumed'; a ROM array that misses its density target moves every area here",
  "the crossover batch is where the GPU overtakes us on THROUGHPUT.  It says nothing about latency, where a design that never reads weights off-die keeps its advantage at every batch",
